\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Come let us, who in Christ believe,
\par Our common Saviour praise,
\par To Him with joyful voices give
\par The glory of His grace.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2
\par \cf0\ulnone\b0 2. He now stands knocking at the door
\par Of every sinner's heart;
\par The worst need keep Him out no more,
\par Or force Him to depart.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Through grace we hearken to Thy voice,
\par Yield to be saved from sin,
\par In sure and certain hope rejoice,
\par That Thou wilt enter in.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Come quickly in, Thou heavenly Guest,
\par Nor ever hence remove;
\par But sup with us, and let the feast
\par Be everlasting love.
\par                           Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

